  "claim_ceiling": "Autonomist evolved from engineered specialists in 5/12 alternating lineages, 0/12 constant mutualism and 0/12 constant competition. Two mutualism lineages went extinct early, requiring 0/10 survival sensitivity alongside original 0/12. Exploratory exact tests presume independent culture lines and treatment exchangeability. No raw times-to-origin or growth trajectories. Immigration studies are independent cohorts, not the same histories or direct HGT mechanism knockouts. 3/12 versus 6/12 density manipulation is not significant by two-sided Fisher. Source barcode tags and restored deleted operons support recombination, but actual transfer events were not observed in real time. Reverse direction only: no historical shared-to-specialized origin, no empirical K(u), no hysteresis loop. Authors' 17,501 model parameter sets are not biological replicates."
